#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:10 e7b4ee5a885c464697f3d44a986928cc
msgid ""
"A number of SkyRocket drones use ArduPilot as flight control software. "
"This page provides details for advanced users and potential developers on"
" these RTF drones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:14 be543fadd9714da983401c2fc5885add
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:18 6a7c0b23ccff436abd18df52520a42da
msgid ""
"The Journey drones that SkyRocket sells starting end of 2021 are not "
"supported by ArduPilot. See `this ArduPilot forum thread "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/is-the-sky-viper-journey-se-copter-"
"transmitter-pair-user-upgradeable-to-ardupilot/79275>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:22 8b80be4044594f59afb3c895bd989aba
msgid "**2017 models**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:24 8813078c302c4074844e3dc81191ed2e
msgid ""
"The *Sky Viper v2450GPS Drone with Autopilot and GPS* is on sale through "
"`Walmart <https://www.walmart.com/ip/Sky-Viper-Streaming-Drone-with-"
"GPS/797973157>`__, `Amazon <https://www.amazon.com/Sky-Viper-v2450GPS-"
"Streaming-Autopilot/dp/B072HH13VQ/ref=lp_13203361011_1_6>`__ and Costco "
"in the US, Australia, Canada, Chile, France, German, Holland, Lithuania, "
"Mexico, New Zealand, Serbia, UK since October 2017."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:26 e2547d5b7575489f928fdc79c82980a8
msgid ""
"SkyRocket sells a variety of different drones. Of the 2017 models, only "
"the V2450GPS Streaming drone (which will have a white shell) is capable "
"of running ArduPilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:29 e06e8b67c2eb4453913b121b869de1d5
msgid "**2018 models**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:31 d2120970d0264e9ba7821767df891286
msgid ""
"In August 2018, SkyRocket released three new ArduPilot powered drones, "
"the Fury, Scout, and Journey. The Fury and Scout utilize \"SurfaceScan\","
" built on ArduPilot's OpticalFlow feature, to allow for indoor flight "
"stability and position holding, unprecedented in this price range. The "
"Journey, with GPS rather than OpticalFlow, takes lessons learned from the"
" V2450GPS and builds on those for a solid re-release for the full GPS-"
"enabled ArduPilot experience. The flight parameters and firmware for both"
" the Scout and Journey can be easily modified as the user sees fit "
"through the embedded wifi access point, powered by APWeb or using your "
"favorite ground control software. Much of the information on this page, "
"which was written for the V2450GPS, will at least partially apply to "
"these new models, with updates annotated as they are discovered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:36 778a82f0a7324c62b0edac2e7a6111c6
msgid "**2021 models**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:38 ae3f8878efa14eacad8b8f25d48c6661
msgid ""
"The Journey is not sold anymore. Instead a Sky Viper Journey SE is "
"shipped. Resellers might still have the Journey listed but have been "
"observed to ship the Journey SE."
msgstr ""

